# BBCode Scoped Output

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:lumis, path: "."}
])
```

```elixir
code = ~S(const template = `<a href="/x">[url=x]</a>`)

Lumis.highlight!(code,
  language: "javascript",
  formatter: :bbcode_scoped
)
```

```elixir
elixir_code = "defmodule Demo do\n  value = \"[url=x]\"\nend"

Lumis.highlight!(elixir_code,
  language: "elixir",
  formatter: :bbcode_scoped
)
```
